==================================================
PHASE 6 — PROJECT
==================================================

7. Build ONE serious Data Engineering + AI project.

   Project idea:

   AI Data Engineering Incident Assistant

   Architecture:

   Telegram
       ↓
   Python
       ↓
   LLM
       ↓
   AI Agent
       ↓
   Tools
       ├── Databricks SQL
       ├── Job status / monitoring tables
       └── Knowledge base
               ↓
              RAG
       ↓
   Root Cause Analysis
       ↓
   Incident Summary / Suggested Remediation
       ↓
   Telegram response

   Example questions:

   - Why did pipeline XYZ fail?
   - Show today's failed jobs.
   - What was the last successful run?
   - Which tables were affected?
   - Explain this failure.
   - Generate an incident summary.
   - What remediation should be tried?

